    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Dear Adrian,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Two things:<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">                     \r\n</span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Your data set is very small</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p><u></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><span>-<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">                     \r\n</span></span></span><u></u><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Probably the NegBin model is not identifiable (see this paper Dennis, E.B., Morgan, B.J.T., Ridout, M.S. 2015. Computational aspects of N-mixture\r\n models. Biometrics 71, 237–246): estimability can be assessed by re-fitting the model for increasing values of the internal tuning “parameter” K (e.g., setting it to 500, 1000 etc). If the AIC and estimates keep changing, then the parameters are not identifiable.\r\n This happens often with the NegBin mixtures, but only rarely with the Poisson and ZIP mixtures.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">Best regards  --- Marc<u></u><u></u></span></p></div></div>"
    ],
    [
